# TBCGuide - Orc & Troll start: Valley of Trials and Durotar (1-12)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide H_OrcTroll_Durotar
@name Valley of Trials & Durotar
@faction Horde
@races Orc,Troll
@levels 1-12
@zone Durotar
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Orc and troll starting route. The Valley of Trials to about 5, then Razor Hill, Sen'jin Village, the Echo Isles, Tiragarde Keep and Skull Rock. Ends at about 11-12, heading into the Barrens.
@next H_Barrens

accept Your Place In The World | Kaltunk at the valley entrance.
turnin Your Place In The World | Gornek, inside the Den.
accept Cutting Teeth
accept 790 Sarkoth | Hana'zua, wounded near the canyon to the south.
complete Cutting Teeth | Mottled Boars around the valley.
turnin Cutting Teeth
accept Sting of the Scorpid
accept Galgar's Cactus Apple Surprise | Galgar, near the Den (offered after Cutting Teeth).
complete Galgar's Cactus Apple Surprise | Cactus apples beside the cacti.
turnin Galgar's Cactus Apple Surprise
complete 790 Sarkoth [mark=skull] | Sarkoth is a large scorpid north-west of Hana'zua.
turnin 790 Sarkoth
accept 804 Sarkoth
turnin 804 Sarkoth
complete Sting of the Scorpid | Scorpid Workers.
turnin Sting of the Scorpid
accept Vanquish the Betrayers
accept 792 Vile Familiars [class=Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Shaman,Priest,Mage] | Zureetha Fargaze.
accept 1485 Vile Familiars [class=Warlock]
complete 792 Vile Familiars [class=Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Shaman,Priest,Mage] | Vile Familiars in the north-east of the valley.
complete 1485 Vile Familiars [class=Warlock]
turnin 792 Vile Familiars [class=Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Shaman,Priest,Mage]
turnin 1485 Vile Familiars [class=Warlock]
accept Burning Blade Medallion
accept Lazy Peons | Foreman Thazz'ril.
accept A Peon's Burden [optional] | Ukor.
complete Lazy Peons | Use the Foreman's Blackjack on sleeping peons.
turnin Lazy Peons
accept Thazz'ril's Pick
complete Thazz'ril's Pick | Burning Blade Cave, north.
complete Vanquish the Betrayers [mark=cross:Lieutenant Benedict] | Kul Tiras Sailors and Marines at Tiragarde Keep; Lieutenant Benedict is upstairs in the keep.
complete Burning Blade Medallion | Yarrog Baneshadow, deep in the cave.
turnin Thazz'ril's Pick
turnin Vanquish the Betrayers
turnin A Peon's Burden [optional] | Innkeeper Grosk, Razor Hill inn.
turnin Burning Blade Medallion
accept Report to Sen'jin Village
train | Trainers are inside the Den.
turnin Report to Sen'jin Village | Master Gadrin, Sen'jin Village.
accept Minshina's Skull
accept Zalazane
accept Report to Orgnil
accept Practical Prey | Vel'rin Fang.
accept A Solvent Spirit | Master Vornal.
accept Thwarting Kolkar Aggression | Lar Prowltusk.
complete A Solvent Spirit | Makrura on the shore around Sen'jin.
complete Practical Prey | Durotar Tigers.
turnin A Solvent Spirit
turnin Practical Prey
complete Minshina's Skull | Echo Isles (walk across the shallow water).
complete Zalazane | Zalazane is on the largest Echo Isle.
turnin Minshina's Skull
turnin Zalazane
complete Thwarting Kolkar Aggression | Kolkar camp south-west of Sen'jin.
turnin Thwarting Kolkar Aggression
turnin Report to Orgnil | Orgnil Soulscar, Razor Hill.
accept Dark Storms
accept Encroachment | Gar'Thok.
accept Break a Few Eggs | Cook Torka.
bind Razor Hill
complete Encroachment | Quilboars and Razormane scouts west of Razor Hill.
complete Break a Few Eggs | Taillasher eggs south of Razor Hill.
complete Dark Storms | Burning Blade cultists at Thunder Ridge.
turnin Encroachment
turnin Break a Few Eggs
turnin Dark Storms
accept Margoz
turnin Margoz | Margoz, Skull Rock.
accept Skull Rock
complete Skull Rock | Burning Blade inside Skull Rock.
turnin Skull Rock
accept Neeru Fireblade
accept Lost But Not Forgotten | Misha Tor'kren, north Durotar.
accept Winds in the Desert | Rezlak at the eastern caravan.
accept Need for a Cure | Rhinag.
complete Lost But Not Forgotten | Durotar Tigers near Misha.
complete Winds in the Desert | Supply sacks scattered in Drygulch Ravine.
complete Need for a Cure | Venomtail Scorpids.
turnin Lost But Not Forgotten
turnin Winds in the Desert
accept Securing the Lines
turnin Need for a Cure
complete Securing the Lines | Dustwind harpies in Drygulch Ravine.
turnin Securing the Lines
turnin Neeru Fireblade | Cleft of Shadow, Orgrimmar.
accept Ak'Zeloth
train | Orgrimmar trainers.
fp Orgrimmar [zone=Orgrimmar]
accept Conscript of the Horde | Takrin Pathseeker, outside the western gate.
level 11
turnin Conscript of the Horde | Kargal Battlescar at the Barrens border.
turnin Ak'Zeloth | Ak'Zeloth, at the same outpost.
accept Crossroads Conscription
note Follow the road west into the Barrens; the Crossroads is the main hub.
